Use the cross product of the vector from the first point to the second with the vector from the first point to each remaining point. If every cross product is zero, all points lie on one line. Cross products avoid division, so vertical lines need no special case.

```php
class Solution {

    /**
     * @param Integer[][] $coordinates
     * @return Boolean
     */
    function checkStraightLine($coordinates) {
        $n = count($coordinates);
        $x0 = $coordinates[0][0];
        $y0 = $coordinates[0][1];
