inference_trace:
Sort the array in descending order, then take elements from the largest until the taken sum is strictly greater than the sum of the remaining elements. Taking the largest elements first gives the minimum size, and among subsets of that size it gives the maximum sum.

```php
class Solution {

    /**
     * @param Integer[] $nums
     * @return Integer[]
     */
    function minSubsequence($nums) {
        rsort($nums);
        $total = array_sum($nums);
        $cur = 0;
        $res = [];
        foreach ($nums as $v) {
            $cur += $v;
            $res[] = $v;
            if ($cur > $total - $cur) {
                break;
            }
        }
        return $res;
    }
}
```

