Sort with a custom comparator: compare by the number of 1 bits first, then by value. The popcount is computed with a simple loop.

```php
class Solution {

    /**
     * @param Integer[] $arr
     * @return Integer[]
     */
    function sortByBits($arr) {
        $pc = function($x) {
            $c = 0;
            while ($x > 0) {
                $c += $x & 1;
                $x >>= 1;
            }
            return $c;
        };
        usort($arr, function($a, $b) use ($pc) {
            $pa = $pc($a);
            $pb = $pc($b);
            if ($pa !== $pb) return $pa - $pb;
            return $a - $b;
        });
        return $arr;
    }
}
```

